<!-- ═══════════════════════════ HOW IT WORKS ═══════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section border-b border-hairline" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="loop-title">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <SectionIntro eyebrow="How it works" headingId="loop-title">
      <Fragment slot="title">One loop, from monthly goals to monthly progress</Fragment>
      Intent connects planning, focus, recovery and reflection, so your goals carry on after a session ends, after an interruption, and after you close the app.
    </SectionIntro>

    <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6" data-reveal-group>
      <li class="loop-card">
        <p class="loop-step text-plan-soft">01 · Plan</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Set monthly goals</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Decide what this month is about and how you'll measure it: active days, sessions, focus time, or no number at all.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="loop-card">
        <p class="loop-step text-plan-soft">02 · Plan</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Plan today</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Add today's tasks, estimate them, mark what's important, and link each one to the monthly goal it moves forward.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="loop-card">
        <p class="loop-step text-focus-soft">03 · Focus</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Pick one current mission</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Choose a single task and start a focus session: 15, 25, 45 or 60 minutes, a custom length, or open-ended.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="loop-card border-recovery/35 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1b1c24] to-[#15161d]">
        <p class="loop-step text-recovery-soft">04 · Return <span class="text-fg-muted">— the core difference</span></p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Come back after distraction</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Press “I got distracted”, or come back from a locked or sleeping PC, and Intent asks how to count the time away. Then you pick up where you left off.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="loop-card">
        <p class="loop-step text-recovery-soft">05 · Reflect</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Wrap up the day</h3>
        <p class="card-body">A short evening reflection: what got done, an honest check on important tasks, and where unfinished work should go.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="loop-card">
        <p class="loop-step text-plan-soft">06 · Review</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Review the week and month</h3>
        <p class="card-body">See focus time, sessions, completion and how often you came back after interruptions, then decide which goals carry into next month.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

